@startuml LabourBridge_DFD_Level0

title LabourBridge - Level 0 DFD (Context Diagram)

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #000000
}

skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #000000
}

skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
  BorderColor #000000
}

actor "Worker" as Worker
actor "Employer" as Employer
actor "Admin" as Admin

rectangle "LabourBridge\nSystem" as System #90CAF9 {
}

database "Email Service" as Email
database "SMS Gateway" as SMS
database "Payment Gateway" as Payment
database "Cloud Storage" as Storage

' Worker interactions
Worker -down-> System : Registration Details\nLogin Credentials\nProfile Information\nJob Applications\nCommunity Participation
System -up-> Worker : Job Listings\nApplication Status\nNotifications\nRecommendations\nCommunity Updates

' Employer interactions
Employer -down-> System : Registration Details\nLogin Credentials\nCompany Profile\nJob Postings\nApplication Reviews
System -up-> Employer : Worker Applications\nTalent Pool\nAnalytics\nNotifications\nShortlisted Candidates

' Admin interactions
Admin -down-> System : System Configuration\nUser Management\nContent Moderation
System -up-> Admin : System Reports\nUser Analytics\nPlatform Statistics

' External Services
System -right-> Email : Email Notifications
Email -left-> System : Delivery Status

System -right-> SMS : SMS Alerts
SMS -left-> System : Delivery Status

System -down-> Payment : Payment Requests
Payment -up-> System : Payment Confirmation

System -down-> Storage : Document Upload
Storage -up-> System : File URLs

note right of System
  **Core Functions:**
  - User Authentication
  - Profile Management
  - Job Posting & Search
  - Application Processing
  - Notifications
  - Analytics & Reporting
  - Community Management
end note

@enduml
